cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Krasnal-ID: fine-grained visual instance retrieval of Wrocław's dwarf statues"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for fine-grained visual instance retrieval of Wrocław's bronze dwarf
  statues, and the dataset it produced: 1,691 attributed Wikimedia Commons photographs of 306
  individual statues, with DINOv2 and CLIP embeddings and a leave-one-out evaluation protocol.
  DINOv2 reaches 93.1% top-1 across the 306-class pool with no fine-tuning. The `license` field
  below covers the source code only. The photographs keep their individual Creative Commons and
  public-domain terms, recorded per image; see LICENSES.md in the published dataset.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Turhan Can"
    family-names: "Kargın"
version: "0.8.0"
date-released: "2026-09-06"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/turhancan97/krasnal-id"
url: "https://turhancan97.github.io/krasnal-id/"
keywords:
  - instance retrieval
  - fine-grained recognition
  - image retrieval
  - cultural heritage
  - public art
